    "title": "Garmin Forerunner 970",
    "description": "The Garmin Forerunner 970 is a high-performance sports smartwatch designed to elevate athletic training. It features an AMOLED display with an optional always-on mode, detailed built-in mapping, and an impressive battery life of up to 15 days in smartwatch mode. Built for durability and function, the watch is constructed with a Titanium bezel and a Sapphire Crystal lens, paired with a comfortable silicone strap. It offers advanced fitness tracking, including Training Readiness, heart rate monitoring, Pulse Ox blood oxygen saturation, and advanced sleep insights. Connectivity is seamless with Bluetooth, ANT+, and Wi-Fi, and it includes convenient features like Garmin Pay, music storage, and a built-in speaker and microphone for calls and texts via a compatible smartphone.",
